  "details": "Hey-oh. I'm currenty experiencing a slight issue with the website ... the whole left side (the menu) is gone, rendering the website unusable. Any screen width below 1440px collapses the menu and enables the menu button (as it should). But the problem is ... screen widths of EXACTLY 1440px lose their menu and DON'T get a menu button. Only resolutions starting at 1441px return to the regular full screen view.\n\nThis kinda sucks and I'm kindly asking you to fix your media queries. Please let me enjoy a functioning the full screen website like before. Free me from the soul-killing mobile layout. I have a 13\" Laptop of real estate ... let me use it.\n\nMachine in Question:\n\nMacbook Air M1\n\nChrome 147 - Screen size: 1440x900\n\nthx, bai",
